{"name": "Monster Park Tycoon", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/b93d7e12ae01cab92f7d674e89eed939.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span><strong>You are running a park. You are running a cult. Ideally, nobody important notices the second part.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/d73dddda43effad25849561c030cd04f.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is not a normal park.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Monster Park Tycoon</strong>, you build and manage a park filled with creatures like zombies, vampires, werewolves and all manner of ghoulish attraction<i>s</i>. Behind the scenes, your operation is run by a not very smart cult devoted to the Dark Lord.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visitors come for a day, but some of them end up staying a little longer than planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/7003b67beba5f9aed0b6707ef813a3c0.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/7003b67beba5f9aed0b6707ef813a3c0.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/7003b67beba5f9aed0b6707ef813a3c0.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/55425764b02776b5bcaec20cca7dbdad.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your cult is responsible for keeping the park running. Place traps disguised as harmless park props to capture unwary souls. Once they are in your hands, you decide what happens next:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feed them to your monsters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brainwash them into new cultists!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sacrifice them to gain Faith!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Brainwashing is a very sophisticated art and your only way to grow your workforce, so every visitor matters. You can even take advantage of break outs \u2013 who does not want two zombies for the price of one?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/d0eb4c191afc3411d3d22a0b93300978.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/d0eb4c191afc3411d3d22a0b93300978.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/d0eb4c191afc3411d3d22a0b93300978.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/5b547464478dddbaf75a90aeca946d18.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juggle park design, creature care, media relations, and mandatory blood rituals to appease the CEO (Creator of Eternal Obscurity). Build exhibits, connect them with paths, and place the facilities your visitors expect.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the same time, you are managing a second layer of the park that most people never see. A well-designed park brings in more visitors. More visitors means more opportunities, if you know what I mean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/6167acb6b217f70993914b4e94b86800.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/6167acb6b217f70993914b4e94b86800.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/6167acb6b217f70993914b4e94b86800.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/271769665628a32daabece5a9edf671e.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your exhibits are filled with monsters, not animals. Each creature has its own requirements:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diets such as brains, blood, meat, or souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conditions that improve their exhibit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Behaviors that can become a problem if ignored</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some monsters can convert visitors when they attack, others can summon additional threats. If something escapes, it will create total, unhinged chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/50d7536cf2ea5465337ec41570c895c8.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/50d7536cf2ea5465337ec41570c895c8.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/50d7536cf2ea5465337ec41570c895c8.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/9e50d4e67cff81ff58373aebb1fbb8c1.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Problems will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monsters can escape and spread chaos through your park. Dealing with nosey reporters, PR disasters, panicked parkgoers, and crazy saboteurs is just one more Tuesday. Keeping everything contained is just as important as growing your park.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/2407b49e06b4cffacbe5e1b6a18a1e5d.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/2407b49e06b4cffacbe5e1b6a18a1e5d.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/2407b49e06b4cffacbe5e1b6a18a1e5d.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/18a317c50dba9c9aaf8762b45270ad58.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Progress comes from expanding both your park and your cult. Generate Faith to unlock the Dark Lord\u2019s Favors and gain access to new buildings and systems. Send cultists on expeditions to unlock new monsters and continue expanding your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build, summon, manage, and unlock. <strong>Then deal with whatever goes wrong.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/f489977a050bddde83879b42940eccaa.poster.avif?t=1787756266\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/f489977a050bddde83879b42940eccaa.webm?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/extras/f489977a050bddde83879b42940eccaa.mp4?t=1787756266\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build and manage the ultimate monster park. From fascinating abominations to world-ending horrors, your park isn't just for show \u2013 it's the cover of a secret (not very smart) cult. Kidnap visitors, turn them into creatures, and keep everything under control in this darkly comedic tycoon game.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4556830/2956f3b4c98dccbb546ebe2c5cca3c05764e70f9/header.jpg?t=1787756266", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Strategy", "City Builder", "Funny", "Management", "Top-Down"], "developers": "OverPowered Team", "publishers": "OverPowered Team", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4556830", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "26 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ARd-usUzlac", "first_seen": 1787695200.0, "review_rank": 57}